window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Burned by love, Annette Murphy is done with men, or so she believes. A twist of fate and a phone call offer a fresh start in Key West. Tasked to manage a haunted bed and breakfast, Paradise West, she immediately dives in and tries her best to ignore the attention of one man who is hell-bent on breaking down her walls and finding his way into her heart.</p> <p>Life has been easy for Gus Reyes—friends, work, money, women—and now he’s finally met the woman of his dreams. Determined to charm Annette, Gus devises a plan to earn her trust and win her heart.</p> <p>But when a secret from Annette’s past threatens everything, Gus has to prove that nothing will deter him from his goal: her love.</p>"; 
